[
    {
        "content": "<p>The progress printing in the mathlib cache executable has a curious bug: the relevant code</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">-- Clear to end of line to avoid remnants from longer previous messages</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">useAnsi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">msg</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">msg</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">++</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"err\">\\</span><span class=\"s2\">x1b[K\"</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>only clears the current line. Once the output is wider than the terminal (i.e., overflows onto a second or third line), only the last line is cleared. On an 80x24 terminal, this manifests in output like this</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8047</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8047</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">98</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">39</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">804</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8061</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8061</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">63</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">804</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8069</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8069</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">65</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">806</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8078</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8078</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">125</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">80</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8089</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8089</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">202</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">80</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8103</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8103</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">92</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">809</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8114</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8114</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">810</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8118</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8118</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">101</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">81</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8123</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8123</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">27</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">812</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8129</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8129</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">16</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">812</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8134</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8134</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">95</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">813</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8136</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8136</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">42</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">813</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8138</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8138</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">26</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">813</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8140</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">26</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">81</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">38</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Is there a way to get the current terminal size in Lean, to fix this property?</p>",
        "id": 608424486,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Rothgang",
        "timestamp": 1783337893
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I have been using the terminal for 35 years and had assumed that this phenomenon was one that had never and would never go away :-) I see it all the time when compiling on command line and just assumed that this was normal. It would be so cool to see the back of it!</p>",
        "id": 608521503,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
        "timestamp": 1783365667
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Note that \"clear the past N lines in the terminal\" (for fixed N) is the relatively easy part. The hard part is finding out what N should be, i.e. querying the terminal size from the application. Otherwise, I would have posted a fix for the cache issue already.</p>",
        "id": 608838658,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Rothgang",
        "timestamp": 1783459223
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>(And of course, everything related to terminals is a huge rabbit hole. But even a best-effort version that's much better than before would be great to have. I don't expect all code to be robust when resizing the terminal mid-operation (for example), but some basics would be nice.)</p>",
        "id": 608838748,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Rothgang",
        "timestamp": 1783459270
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/41509\">#41509</a> has a prototypical implementation of a fix to the cache --- which works up to off-by-one errors. Be my guest to help with debugging (otherwise I'll slowly do this over time).</p>",
        "id": 609042036,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Rothgang",
        "timestamp": 1783531836
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think there's a simpler approach, I came up with:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">overwriteMessage</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cols</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getWindowSize</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">println</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lineCount</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">split</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">'\\</span><span class=\"n\">n'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|&gt;.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">positions</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">length</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cols</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|&gt;.</span><span class=\"n\">fold</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"err\">\\</span><span class=\"s2\">x1b[J\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- first clear everything after the cursor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">++</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- then print the message</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">++</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"err\">\\</span><span class=\"s2\">x1b[G\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- go back to the start of the line</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lineCount</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">++</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"err\">\\</span><span class=\"s2\">x1b[{lineCount - 1}F\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- go back the remainder of lines</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getStdout</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">stream</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">putStr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">text</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">stream</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">flush</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>which you can use like this:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\